  "origin": {
    "summary": "Honors the thirteen killed and thirty wounded at Fort Hood, Texas, on November 5, 2009 — many of them members of the 20th Engineer Battalion. Every couplet is separated by a 400m run: twenty reps, run, repeat, until six movements are gone.",
